<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">09092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's Revolutionary Guard struck American air bases inside Jordan and Bahrain overnight, and Jordanian interceptors stopped eighteen of the twenty missiles fired at one of them.</s> <s>The strikes answer the American destruction of five Iranian tankers near Kharg Island — the terminal that loads most of Iran's crude, and with it most of the state's income.</s> <s>Two Arab countries that never chose this war are now inside its target list, by the terms of basing agreements their governments signed decades ago.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A year after Nepal's youth uprising, Liza Adhikari's arm still hasn't healed from the bullet that security forces put through it outside parliament, when she was twenty-one.</s> <s>She travelled to India for nerve surgery and carries the cost herself, while the government has marked the protests with a public holiday and charged no officer with anything.</s> <s>That's the arithmetic of an uprising — cheap for a state to survive politically, expensive for the people who survive it physically.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria is rewriting the national peace policy it wrote in twenty-twelve, after seven thousand eight hundred and twenty-five people were abducted in a single year.</s> <s>Defence spending rose fifty-five percent, according to Stockholm's peace research institute, and the kidnapping economy grew anyway — because one framework is being asked to cover insurgency in the northeast, banditry in the northwest, communal killing in the middle belt and oil theft in the delta.</s> <s>Those five conflicts run on land, water, ransom and doctrine, and almost nothing in their drivers overlaps.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the Kazakh village of Qyzylsay, women rise at four in the morning to carry water, and ten of them have now started measuring the hours it takes.</s> <s>Kazakhstan loses between forty and sixty percent of its rural water to leaking pipes, and what remains depends on rivers that rise in China and Kyrgyzstan before they ever reach a Kazakh tap.</s> <s>Unpaid labour doesn't appear in a budget line — so the pipeline that would end it never competes for money.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Human Rights Watch is urging governments to withhold recognition and frozen reserves from the Taliban until Afghan girls can return to school past the sixth grade.</s> <s>Members of the United Nations vote soon on renewing the special envoy's mandate, which is the practical lever the appeal is aimed at.</s> <s>Meanwhile a whole cohort of Afghan girls is aging out of education entirely, and no future policy reverses that particular loss.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary has expelled Russian diplomats — its first openly anti-Kremlin act in sixteen years, and the end of Moscow's most dependable veto inside the European Union.</s> <s>Expulsion under the Vienna Convention needs no charges and no evidence made public, which is the standard way states remove people they believe are intelligence officers.</s> <s>What Budapest wants in exchange for the turn, and from whom, hasn't been said out loud.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Washington has banned Canadian dairy, alcohol and motorcycles from entering the United States outright, days after Ottawa's counter-tariffs on twenty billion dollars of American goods took effect.</s> <s>A tariff still permits the trade at a price; a ban removes the market, which is a change of category rather than degree in an eighteen-month trade war.</s> <s>Mark Carney is courting Europe in response, but sixty-eight percent of Canadian exports still travel south, and the pipelines and rail lines all run that way too.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brent crude neared ninety-nine dollars and fifty cents a barrel on Wednesday, and the first market to feel it was Mumbai — the Sensex fell four hundred and seventy-four points before American trading had even opened.</s> <s>India imports the overwhelming share of the oil it burns, so a war two thousand kilometres away reprices Indian savings within hours.</s> <s>Spare production capacity is no help here, because the risk isn't how much oil exists... it's whether it can move.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Islamic Development Bank has pledged Bangladesh one billion dollars toward domestic refining capacity.</s> <s>Bangladesh buys refined fuel rather than crude, which means it pays the crude price and the refining margin both, and Brent has risen more than ten percent in a month.</s> <s>Refineries take years to build, so the relief, God willing, arrives for a price shock nobody can yet describe.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia and North Korea have opened a road bridge across the Tumen River, where a single railway had carried everything between them for sixty-seven years.</s> <s>Sanctions on Pyongyang are enforced mostly by watching ships, and there's no comparable system for counting trucks across a land border.</s> <s>The bottleneck that enforcement quietly depended on has just been removed by concrete.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Archaeologists near Chan Chan in northern Peru have opened a tomb holding at least thirty-eight bodies, buried with metal weapons and left undisturbed for six hundred years.</s> <s>Almost every other known Chimú burial was looted, and what looting destroys isn't chiefly the objects — it's the arrangement, the relationship between one body and another that lets a civilisation be read rather than guessed at.</s> <s>Researchers haven't yet said what the arrangement here appears to mean.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers have identified a wheat gene variant that raises how much applied nitrogen a plant actually captures, without costing grain yield — a trade-off that has held for decades.</s> <s>Nitrogen fertiliser is manufactured from natural gas, and gas is repricing upward alongside the Gulf war, so the same harvest on less fertiliser is a foreign-exchange story for wheat-growing states from the Sahel to South Asia.</s> <s>Field performance across real environments remains unproven, and the paper isn't yet in its final published form.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Heavy trucks are two point three percent of China's vehicle fleet and cause as much as fifty-five percent of its transport carbon emissions.</s> <s>Electric models reached only twenty-eight percent of last year's sales, because a loaded forty-nine-tonne tractor needs energy delivered faster than most depots can physically supply it.</s> <s>Whether that's solved by megawatt charging or by swapping batteries decides who ends up owning the infrastructure of Chinese freight.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Microsoft published nine hundred and seventy-three security vulnerabilities in a single monthly release, the largest on record.</s> <s>America's cybersecurity agency says two of them are already being exploited, and until somebody reads the advisory carefully those two look exactly like the other nine hundred and seventy-one.</s> <s>The vendor discharges its duty by publishing; the work lands on hospital and ministry technicians who have neither the staff nor the hours for it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nine in ten European websites now route their traffic through Cloudflare, according to a study tracking forty-four thousand one hundred and forty-three European companies.</s> <s>That isn't only market share — the company terminates the encryption for nearly all of it, meaning the traffic is readable at that point by design.</s> <s>Europe has legislated for a decade about where data is stored, and almost not at all about where it's decrypted.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mistral has raised three billion euros in Paris, the largest technology funding round in European history.</s> <s>Every other laboratory that reached this scale closed its model weights, and open weights are precisely what lets a country run a system without a licence somebody else can revoke — though the training data and the code stay private either way.</s> <s>Investors funding frontier-scale growth may yet ask for the same closure, and the answer will say a good deal about European technological independence.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>